  "notes": "{強化|きょうか} means to strengthen or reinforce something.\n\nCommon collocations:\n- {強化|きょうか}する (to strengthen)\n- {体力|たいりょく}{強化|きょうか} (physical fitness strengthening)\n- {防災|ぼうさい}{強化|きょうか} (disaster prevention strengthening)\n- {強化|きょうか}ガラス (tempered glass)\n- {強化|きょうか}{合宿|がっしゅく} (intensive training camp)\n\nRelated terms:\n- {増強|ぞうきょう} (reinforcement, augmentation)\n- {補強|ほきょう} (reinforcement, support)\n- {弱体|じゃくたい}化 (weakening - opposite)\n\nUsage areas:\n- Sports, military, business, security, education",
